[statement]
A condition whose `!` entry names the package's own name never holds,
whatever version the entry admits: `b` 1's condition is `e` and `!b>5`,
`e` is installed, and `b` is not. Required, `b` is installed as any
package is.

[repository]
P:b
V:1
i:!b>5 e

P:e
V:1

[request]
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
